+At the session working-directory root, literal directory prefixes in glob patterns prune unrelated directories before traversal. The original pattern, hidden/ignored inclusion, VCS exclusions, modification ordering, and empty results for absent prefixes are preserved. Searches rooted elsewhere keep their existing matching behavior.
